31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,That is a bold lie. I am a villager. Jonathan is likely the werewolf trying to frame me.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"What?! Already? Jonathan seems so nice, though!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It's a direct confrontation. One of them must be lying.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,How provocative. A Seer's claim on the very first day. How efficient.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am the Seer. I saw the truth last night.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,A common claim for a werewolf to gain trust. Why would I be the target so quickly?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"If Mizuki is the werewolf, she'd try to act confident, right?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,Mizuki is always confident. It's hard to tell.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. However, Jonathan's certainty is quite compelling, isn't it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I trust my vision. We should execute Mizuki.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If you execute me, you lose a valuable human. Jonathan is the one we should fear.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,I believe Jonathan! He's too quiet to be a mean wolf!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning toward Jonathan's side. It's a strong lead.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While I appreciate the drama, logic suggests following the Seer's lead unless proven otherwise.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
